  "title": {
   "en": "Yuuhei Reijou no Seirei Kon ~Taiju no Seirei ni Dekiai Sarete Imasu~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "幽閉令嬢の精霊婚～大樹の精霊に溺愛されています～"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Imprisoned Noblewoman and the Great Tree Spirit"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In a kingdom where the Great Tree of Life—Fikas Vela—is revered as sacred, Almeria, the adopted daughter of a count’s family, is treated with cruelty and disdain. She is accused of defiling the holy grounds for simply crossing the sacred boundary of the divine tree.\n\nDespite the isolation and the harsh treatment from those around her, Almeria tries to live quietly. But one day, she becomes entangled in a dangerous conspiracy tied to a deep secret surrounding the tree—one that puts her very life at risk.\n\nAnd in a moment of despair, with danger closing in…\nA majestic and mysterious entity appears before her—\nthe Great Spirit dwelling within the sacred tree."
  },
